WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,340
I'm going crazy

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:15,340
Don't worry, wait until the plane is far away before going out to throw the medicine away.

3
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,380
Take care of your points

4
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:19,780
One share from Ichigo is the fairest

5
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,500
A family of five can get the same amount as one person

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,500
What is this fair?

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,500
It should be done on a per-capita basis

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:31,500
Yes, yes, yes, please protect the head and stop arguing.

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,700
Food and medicine are divided according to the number of people in the line.

10
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,700
I have the list of the most important things for everyone to survive right here.

11
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,100
It’s clear how many people live in each house now, so don’t even think about it.

12
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,110
In order not to make people think

13
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:40,110
Me and Mo Mo are easy to bully

14
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:42,110
I deliberately said that I still have parents at home, although I didn’t mention Momo

15
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:43,510
But now it’s really three people’s share

16
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:44,710
I have enough supplies at home

17
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:45,710
The extra supplies can be used

18
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:46,710
Distribute to those who need it more

19
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:48,710
It’s not easy for a little girl to swallow more supplies

20
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:50,310
Thank you, Sister Shen

21
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:51,710
Food can still be dropped from the reserve

22
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:52,910
The medicine is getting harder and harder to replenish

23
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:56,330
This must stay

24
00:00:56,330 --> 00:00:58,730
At least someone is looking after us

25
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:00,730
This is why China can rise
